From f01cf9606ad316b014060642fcc9693178df3279 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stephan Raj Ignatious Durairaj <signatio@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:13:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 597/598] Fix hostapd disconnect reason propagation

Prefer the hostapd AP-STA-DISCONNECTED reason, falling back to the cached on-air reason when the event lacks one. Keep cached reasons for duplicate global and per-VAP notifications.

Remove temporary RECONSTRA tags and two unreachable failure logs.

Signed-off-by: Stephan Raj Ignatious Durairaj <signatio@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
