 .../slave/tasks/ap_autoconfiguration_task.cpp | 16 ++--
 .../bwl/nl80211/ap_wlan_hal_nl80211.cpp       | 94 +++++++++++--------
 3 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 64 deletions(-)

